<title>UK: TABLE-GEC yr pretax pre-exceps up 0.6 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-GEC yr pretax pre-exceps up 0.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to end-March 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) pre-exceps 23.6		   vs 22.9</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		14.7		   vs 22.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 9.89		   vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 13.15		  vs 12.51</p>
<p> Pretax pre-exceps pft  1,010		  vs 1,004</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    707		    vs 981</p>
<p> Turnover		   11,147		 vs 10,990</p>
<p> Net cash		   1,086		  vs 1,152</p>
<p> Exceptional charge     303		    vs 23</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British electronics and defence group is General Electric Co Plc. The company said the strong pound cut 19 million stg from profits. Operating profit at the GEC-Marconi division rose by 18.6 percent and orders were up 40 percent.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
